# JDK Vault

This vault documents Java JDK changes across every major release. For each JDK
version it holds the archived project page, the official release notes, and its
JDK Enhancement Proposals (JEPs), each extracted from the original source as
readable text.

Notes are independent markdown files connected through inline tags:
`#jdk/{version}` for the release and `#link-type/{type}` (project-page,
release-notes, jep) for the kind of content. No note depends on another — the
tags are what Obsidian uses to link and group them.

